{"id":"ned74a081d21a","url":"https://www.dental-tribune.com/news/kulzer-restructures-leadership-amid-integration-with-ultradent-products/","title":"Kulzer restructures leadership amid integration with Ultradent Products","source":"Dental Tribune","date":"2026-11-27T09:06:12.000Z","byline":"Dental Tribune International","image":"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/ae55a8d2/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz04MDA7aD04MDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/dt-user.gif","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<img src=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/ae55a8d2/cmVzaXplLWNyb3Aodz04MDA7aD04MDApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD1naWYp/wp-content/themes/dt/images/dt-user.gif\" alt=\"Dental Tribune International\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p>Dental Tribune International</p> <p>Fri. 27. November 2026</p> share save <h2><p>Kulzer has announced changes to its management structure as part of its ongoing integration with Ultradent Products. Chris Holden, former CEO of Kulzer, has assumed a new position as chief strategy and integration officer at MC Dental Holdings America, the holding company that oversees Mitsui Chemicals’ oral care business, including Kulzer and Ultradent Products. Reporting to Shingo Ono, president and CEO of the holding company, Holden will help oversee the integration of the two dental businesses.</p>\n</h2> <p>In August 2026, Dirk Jeffs assumed the role of CEO of the global Kulzer Group in addition to his existing role as CEO of Ultradent Products. In this dual role, he is responsible for both companies’ dental operations within MC Dental Holdings America.</p>\n<p>Heinz Seidl succeeds Holden as managing director of Kulzer. As area vice-president for European operations, he will also assume responsibility for the organisational and operational management of Kulzer. In addition, Aurelio Gisco has joined Kulzer’s management board as area vice-president for commercial operations in Europe, overseeing sales and marketing. He is also responsible for the South Korean, Chinese, Middle Eastern and African markets. Seidl and Gisco bring decades of dental industry experience and extensive leadership experience at Ultradent Products to their new roles. They will both continue in their roles as area vice-presidents for Ultradent Products, reporting to Jeffs.</p>\n<h2>Organisational integration</h2>\n<p>Kulzer and Ultradent Products both have long histories in the dental industry. Kulzer has been developing products for dental practices and laboratories for almost a century, and Ultradent Products has been developing dental materials, equipment and instruments for more than 45 years. The integration brings together the expertise and product portfolios of the two companies. The new management structure supports the ongoing integration by consolidating responsibilities across the two companies and aligning their decision-making processes. More information is available on the websites of <a href=\"https://kulzerus.com/en-us/en-us/home/home.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kulzer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.ultradent.eu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ultradent Products</a>.</p>\n<picture><source srcset=\"https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/0ef3d9e8/cmVzaXplKHc9MTMyMDtoPTE3NjApOnNoYXJwZW4obGV2ZWw9MCk6b3V0cHV0KGZvcm1hdD13ZWJwKQ/up/dt/2026/11/Aurelio-Gisco_PR.jpg 1320w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/fc706ff2/cmVzaXplKHc9MTU5O2g9MjEyKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/Aurelio-Gisco_PR.jpg 159w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/2b619fa3/cmVzaXplKHc9Mjk3O2g9Mzk2KTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/Aurelio-Gisco_PR.jpg 297w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/198f461f/cmVzaXplKHc9NjYwO2g9ODgwKTpzaGFycGVuKGxldmVsPTApOm91dHB1dChmb3JtYXQ9d2VicCk/up/dt/2026/11/Aurelio-Gisco_PR.jpg 660w, https://cdn.dental-tribune.com/dti/0001/c374bbb8/cmVzaXplKHc9OTkwO2g9MTMyMCk6c2hhcnBlbihsZXZlbD0wKTpvdX